1
00:00:00,762 --> 00:00:03,632
(Sheldon:)It's like living
with a lactose-intolerant parrot.

2
00:00:05,934 --> 00:00:07,734
(Leonard:)Trust me. Call her.

3
00:00:08,169 --> 00:00:09,499
(Amy:)Fine.

4
00:00:09,671 --> 00:00:11,871
(Sheldon:)It's a shame you didn't go
to dinner with us...

5
00:00:12,040 --> 00:00:15,200
(Sheldon:)...because the buffet you're about to enjoy
only serves humble pie...

6
00:00:15,376 --> 00:00:18,006
(Sheldon:)...a dessert much less tasty
than frozen yogurt.

7
00:00:18,179 --> 00:00:19,439
(Sheldon:)I was this close.

8
00:00:22,951 --> 00:00:24,781
(Amy(on skype):)What?

9
00:00:25,687 --> 00:00:26,777
(Sheldon:)You'll appreciate this.

10
00:00:26,955 --> 00:00:29,615
(Sheldon:)Leonard has some ridiculous notion
that you're mad at me.

11
00:00:29,791 --> 00:00:32,781
(Sheldon:)Tell him you're not mad at me.
Go ahead, set him straight.

12
00:00:32,961 --> 00:00:34,451
(Amy:)I'm mad at you, Sheldon.

13
00:00:35,430 --> 00:00:36,860
(Sheldon:)Hmm...

14
00:00:37,031 --> 00:00:38,691
(Sheldon:)Eat one of your Luna Bars.

15
00:00:40,535 --> 00:00:44,025
(Sheldon:)Very often, when women think
they're angry, they're really just hungry.

16
00:00:45,640 --> 00:00:47,070
(Amy:)I'm not hungry.

17
00:00:47,976 --> 00:00:50,306
(Amy:)Your friend insulted me
and you didn't do anything.

18
00:00:50,478 --> 00:00:54,138
(Sheldon:)Precisely. I didn't do anything.

19
00:00:55,216 --> 00:00:58,086
(Sheldon:)Now, does someone feel like checking
her emotional math?

